{
  "title": "Everyone Has a Number",
  "essay": "after Roland Barthes, Mythologies (1957)",
  "total": 64.407,
  "lines": [
    {
      "shot": "s01",
      "text": "In my town, everyone has a number floating over their head.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 3.921,
      "next": 4.271
    },
    {
      "shot": "s02",
      "text": "Nobody remembers who put it there.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 4.271,
      "end": 6.329,
      "next": 6.679
    },
    {
      "shot": "s03",
      "text": "Mine was two hundred and twelve.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 6.679,
      "end": 8.6,
      "next": 8.9
    },
    {
      "shot": "s03",
      "text": "Low.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 8.9,
      "end": 9.485,
      "next": 9.785
    },
    {
      "shot": "s03",
      "text": "Embarrassing.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 9.785,
      "end": 10.66,
      "next": 11.01
    },
    {
      "shot": "s04",
      "text": "The baker had nine.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 11.01,
      "end": 12.287,
      "next": 12.587
    },
    {
      "shot": "s04",
      "text": "Just nine.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 12.587,
      "end": 13.534,
      "next": 13.884
    },
    {
      "shot": "s05",
      "text": "But every morning, before anyone woke up,",
      "card": null,
      "start": 13.884,
      "end": 16.517,
      "next": 16.667
    },
    {
      "shot": "s06",
      "text": "she left bread on the doorsteps of houses with no lights on.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 16.667,
      "end": 20.343,
      "next": 20.693
    },
    {
      "shot": "s07",
      "text": "The guy with fifty thousand never said hi to anyone.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 20.693,
      "end": 24.167,
      "next": 24.517
    },
    {
      "shot": "s08",
      "text": "He was busy making his number go up.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 24.517,
      "end": 26.758,
      "next": 27.258
    },
    {
      "shot": "s09",
      "text": "So I did what everyone does.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 27.258,
      "end": 29.09,
      "next": 29.44
    },
    {
      "shot": "s10",
      "text": "I started performing.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 29.44,
      "end": 30.744,
      "next": 31.094
    },
    {
      "shot": "s11",
      "text": "Nine hundred.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 31.094,
      "end": 32.08,
      "next": 32.33
    },
    {
      "shot": "s11",
      "text": "Three thousand.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 32.33,
      "end": 33.416,
      "next": 33.666
    },
    {
      "shot": "s11",
      "text": "Ten thousand.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 33.666,
      "end": 34.677,
      "next": 35.177
    },
    {
      "shot": "s12",
      "text": "And the bigger it got, the fewer people actually knew my name.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 35.177,
      "end": 38.804,
      "next": 39.404
    },
    {
      "shot": "s13",
      "text": "One morning,",
      "card": null,
      "start": 39.404,
      "end": 40.277,
      "next": 40.677
    },
    {
      "shot": "s13",
      "text": "there was no bread.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 40.677,
      "end": 41.816,
      "next": 42.316
    },
    {
      "shot": "s14",
      "text": "The baker was sick.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 42.316,
      "end": 43.551,
      "next": 44.051
    },
    {
      "shot": "s15",
      "text": "And I realized no number in town could have told me that.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 44.051,
      "end": 47.298,
      "next": 47.798
    },
    {
      "shot": "s16",
      "text": "So I brought her bread.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 47.798,
      "end": 49.089,
      "next": 50.689
    },
    {
      "shot": "s17",
      "text": "My number didn't move.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 50.689,
      "end": 52.185,
      "next": 52.585
    },
    {
      "shot": "s17",
      "text": "Not even by one.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 52.585,
      "end": 53.931,
      "next": 54.931
    },
    {
      "shot": "s18",
      "text": "Turns out the number never measured what we thought.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 54.931,
      "end": 57.905,
      "next": 58.405
    },
    {
      "shot": "s18",
      "text": "It only measured who was watching.",
      "card": null,
      "start": 58.405,
      "end": 60.407,
      "next": 61.407
    },
    {
      "shot": "card",
      "text": "",
      "card": null,
      "start": 61.407,
      "end": 64.407,
      "next": 64.407
    }
  ],
